    title: "SYNTHETIC_FRAMEWORK_ROLES lacks the framework_role values the IPC linkers write (f-string ipc_send / ipc_receive), so Electron/Phoenix IPC stand-ins are not treated as synthetic nodes (static finding, measure first)"  # 4aa9
